{"version": 1, "packs": [{"run_id": "20260914-e78bab55c0fb", "tag": "TPP-ES", "status": "content_pending", "paper_count": 88, "as_of": "2026-09-14", "updated_at": "2026-09-14T15:09:33.244543+00:00", "mode": "starter", "result_count": 88, "content_done": 10, "content_pending": 78, "guide_status": "complete", "export_path": "docs/starter-pack/20260914-e78bab55c0fb/papers.md", "selected_records": [{"id": "work:50c3fa2ef5759f6032b5fe74", "title": "Deep Continuous-Time State-Space Models for Marked Event Sequences", "score": 10, "route": "conference/neurips-2025/openreview-neurips-2025-74sve2gzww-deep-continuous-time-state-space-models-for-marked-event-sequences", "published": "2025", "publication_date": "2025", "publication_date_precision": "year", "publication_date_source": "conference year only; exact release date unverified", "publication_date_kind": "unknown", "zh_title": "", "summary": "标记时序点过程用于建模不规则时间事件，但现有模型难以兼顾连续时间归纳偏置与表达力。本文提出S2P2，将随机跳跃微分方程与非线性交错，构建基于强度的深度状态空间点过程。方法支持并行扫描训练，具线性复杂度与亚线性扩展。在八个真实数据集上预测似然达最优，平均提升33%。", "tags": [], "reading_status": "complete"}, {"id": "arxiv:2602.01125", "title": "Long-range Modeling and Processing of Multimodal Event Sequences", "score": 10, "route": "20250914-20260913/2602.01125v1", "published": "2026-02-01", "publication_date": "2026-02-01", "publication_date_precision": "day", "publication_date_source": "https://arxiv.org/pdf/2602.01125v1", "publication_date_kind": "arxiv_first_submission", "zh_title": "", "summary": "时序点过程（TPP）可建模异步事件序列，但引入多模态数据后序列长度剧增，注意力模型难以生成长篇连贯文本。本文提出将LLM-based TPP扩展至视觉模态，以文本生成为核心能力，并用基于时间相似度的自适应序列压缩机制缩短序列。采用压缩序列预训练加下游监督微调的两阶段范式。在DanmakuTPP-QA等基准上，预测精度与生成文本分析质量均超越现有最优基线。", "tags": [], "reading_status": "complete"}, {"id": "arxiv:2510.06050", "title": "Edit-Based Flow Matching for Temporal Point Processes", "score": 10, "route": "20250914-20260913/2510.06050v3", "published": "2025-10-07", "publication_date": "2025-10-07", "publication_date_precision": "day", "publication_date_source": "https://arxiv.org/pdf/2510.06050v3", "publication_date_kind": "arxiv_first_submission", "zh_title": "", "summary": "时序点过程建模连续时间事件序列，现有方法多依赖自回归采样，效率受限；近期非自回归扩散模型通过离散马尔可夫链的插入删除来插值噪声与数据。本文提出 Edit Flow 过程，用插入、删除、替换三种编辑操作将噪声传输到数据，并在连续时间马尔可夫链中学习瞬时编辑率。该模型减少生成所需编辑操作总数，在基准 TPP 的无条件与条件生成任务上展现灵活生成能力。", "tags": [], "reading_status": "complete"}, {"id": "arxiv:2509.24762", "title": "In-Context Learning of Temporal Point Processes with Foundation Inference Models", "score": 10, "route": "20250914-20260913/2509.24762v3", "published": "2025-09-29", "publication_date": "2025-09-29", "publication_date_precision": "day", "publication_date_source": "https://arxiv.org/pdf/2509.24762v3", "publication_date_kind": "arxiv_first_submission", "zh_title": "", "summary": "多类事件序列的标记时序点过程（MTPP）建模可揭示动力学规律并预测未来事件，但现有神经网络方法需为每个目标系统单独训练专用模型。本文提出基于摊销推断与上下文学习的基础推断模型FIM-PP，在大规模合成Hawkes过程上预训练，使其能从事件序列上下文直接推断条件强度函数。预训练后无需额外训练即可估计真实数据MTPP，或快速微调适配目标系统。实验表明该方法在常见基准的下一事件预测上达到专用模型水平。", "tags": [], "reading_status": "complete"}, {"id": "arxiv:2607.21098", "title": "Smooth Neural Point Processes via B-Splines", "score": 10, "route": "20250914-20260913/2607.21098v1", "published": "2026-07-23", "publication_date": "2026-07-23", "publication_date_precision": "day", "publication_date_source": "https://arxiv.org/pdf/2607.21098v1", "publication_date_kind": "arxiv_first_submission", "zh_title": "", "summary": "时序点过程（TPP）用神经网络建模时，常需在负对数似然中处理强度函数积分，现有方法多建模补偿器、限制架构且训练串行。本文提出将条件强度函数直接参数化为B样条基函数的非负组合，系数由神经网络预测。该形式可精确计算NLL、保留架构灵活性、支持训练并行化，并借二阶导平方积分实现平滑正则。合成与真实数据实验显示，其计算效率与预测精度均优于参考神经TPP基线。", "tags": [], "reading_status": "complete"}, {"id": "arxiv:2511.06032", "title": "ITPP: Learning Disentangled Event Dynamics in Marked Temporal Point Processes", "score": 10, "route": "20250914-20260913/2511.06032v1", "published": "2025-11-08", "publication_date": "2025-11-08", "publication_date_precision": "day", "publication_date_source": "https://arxiv.org/pdf/2511.06032v1", "publication_date_kind": "arxiv_first_submission", "zh_title": "", "summary": "标记时序点过程建模异步事件序列时，现有方法多采用通道混合策略，将不同事件类型信息压缩进单一固定隐表示，导致类型特异动态被纠缠，性能下降且易过拟合。本文提出ITPP，一种通道独立架构，用基于ODE的编码器-解码器框架解耦事件类型信息，并设计类型感知倒置自注意力显式建模异构事件类型间的通道相关性。在多个真实与合成数据集上，ITPP在预测精度和泛化能力上持续优于现有最先进模型。", "tags": [], "reading_status": "complete"}, {"id": "work:43042cc1622684ab70cf51cb", "title": "Residual TPP: A Unified Lightweight Approach for Event Stream Data Analysis", "score": 10, "route": "conference/icml-2025/openreview-icml-2025-aukbfmtyus-residual-tpp-a-unified-lightweight-approach-for-event-stream-data-analysis", "published": "2025-10-06", "publication_date": "2025-10-06", "publication_date_precision": "day", "publication_date_source": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mlresearch/v267/gh-pages/_config.yml", "publication_date_kind": "proceedings", "zh_title": "", "summary": "事件流数据建模中，简单统计TPP表达力有限，神经TPP计算开销大。本文提出Residual TPP，通过残差事件分解RED量化强度函数拟合质量，识别残差事件，再用Hawkes过程与任意神经TPP分工处理。实验表明其在多领域拟合与预测达SOTA，且计算优势显著。", "tags": [], "reading_status": "complete"}, {"id": "arxiv:2510.20031", "title": "Speculative Sampling for Parametric Temporal Point Processes", "score": 10, "route": "20250914-20260913/2510.20031v1", "published": "2025-10-22", "publication_date": "2025-10-22", "publication_date_precision": "day", "publication_date_source": "https://arxiv.org/pdf/2510.20031v1", "publication_date_kind": "arxiv_first_submission", "zh_title": "", "summary": "时序点过程（TPP）常以自回归模型建模事件序列，采样必须逐步进行，效率受限。本文提出基于拒绝采样的推测采样算法，无需改架构或重训即可并行精确采样多个未来事件。在真实数据集上取得实证加速，兼顾表达力与大规模TPP的高效并行生成。", "tags": [], "reading_status": "complete"}, {"id": "work:f63a95f1cb174b6f9fe27637", "title": "ExPERT: Modeling Human Behavior Under External Stimuli Aware Personalized MTPP", "score": 10, "route": "conference/aaai-2025/aaai-2025-33960-expert-modeling-human-behavior-under-external-stimuli-aware-personalized-mtpp", "published": "2025", "publication_date": "2025", "publication_date_precision": "year", "publication_date_source": "conference year only; exact release date unverified", "publication_date_kind": "unknown", "zh_title": "", "summary": "", "tags": [], "reading_status": "pending"}, {"id": "work:f3ada80ee8ba85f08e2c61d7", "title": "Unlocking Point Processes through Point Set Diffusion", "score": 10, "route": "conference/iclr-2025/openreview-iclr-2025-4anfphj0wf-unlocking-point-processes-through-point-set-diffusion", "published": "2025", "publication_date": "2025", "publication_date_precision": "year", "publication_date_source": "conference year only; exact release date unverified", "publication_date_kind": "unknown", "zh_title": "", "summary": "", "tags": [], "reading_status": "pending"}, {"id": "work:023166ccf93667172aafbf4f", "title": "A Spatio-Temporal Point Process for Fine-Grained Modeling of Reading Behavior", "score": 10, "route": "conference/acl-2025/anthology-2025acl-long1474-a-spatio-temporal-point-process-for-fine-grained-modeling-of-reading-behavior", "published": "2025", "publication_date": "2025", "publication_date_precision": "year", "publication_date_source": "conference year only; exact release date unverified", "publication_date_kind": "unknown", "zh_title": "", "summary": "阅读行为在空间与时间上交替发生注视与眼跳，但传统建模多依赖聚合眼动指标并施加强假设，忽略细粒度时空动态。本文提出基于标记时空点过程的阅读行为概率模型，用Hawkes过程刻画眼跳的时空激发，并将注视时长建模为跨时间卷积的预测因子以捕捉溢出效应。实验显示该模型对人类眼跳拟合优于基线，而引入上下文惊奇度仅带来边际预测提升。", "tags": [], "reading_status": "complete"}, {"id": "arxiv:2608.18791", "title": "Scaling-law-informed neural point processes for earthquake sequence forecasting", "score": 10, "route": "20250914-20260913/2608.18791v1", "published": "2026-08-19", "publication_date": "2026-08-19", "publication_date_precision": "day", "publication_date_source": "https://arxiv.org/pdf/2608.18791v1", "publication_date_kind": "arxiv_first_submission", "zh_title": "", "summary": "地震序列预测需兼顾非线性历史依赖与稳健统计结构。本文提出融合尺度律的神经标记点过程Fusion，将目录历史的神经表示与ETAS时序特征、G-R律震级信息结合，并分离输入震级下限与目标事件阈值。在Amatrice-Visso-Norcia序列上，保留低震级事件时目标事件时间似然最高，优于ETAS与纯神经基线。", "tags": [], "reading_status": "complete"}, {"id": "arxiv:2603.11462", "title": "Bridging Discrete Marks and Continuous Dynamics: Dual-Path Cross-Interaction for Marked Temporal Point Processes", "score": 9, "route": "20250914-20260913/2603.11462v1", "published": "2026-03-12", "publication_date": "2026-03-12", "publication_date_precision": "day", "publication_date_source": "https://arxiv.org/pdf/2603.11462v1", "publication_date_kind": "arxiv_first_submission", "zh_title": "", "summary": "", "tags": [], "reading_status": "pending"}, {"id": "work:6d464afe4679b2aa768553bd", "title": "TPP-SD: Accelerating Transformer Point Process Sampling with Speculative Decoding", "score": 9, "route": "conference/neurips-2025/openreview-neurips-2025-lkqk19tqgx-tpp-sd-accelerating-transformer-point-process-sampling-with-speculative-decoding", "published": "2025", "publication_date": "2025", "publication_date_precision": "year", "publication_date_source": "conference year only; exact release date unverified", "publication_date_kind": "unknown", "zh_title": "", "summary": "", "tags": [], "reading_status": "pending"}, {"id": "arxiv:2511.19375", "title": "Product Depth for Temporal Point Processes Observed Only Up to the First k Events", "score": 9, "route": "20250914-20260913/2511.19375v1", "published": "2025-11-24", "publication_date": "2025-11-24", "publication_date_precision": "day", "publication_date_source": "https://arxiv.org/pdf/2511.19375v1", "publication_date_kind": "arxiv_first_submission", "zh_title": "", "summary": "", "tags": [], "reading_status": "pending"}, {"id": "arxiv:2607.01752", "title": "Efficient Temporal Point Processes via Monotone Alternating Splines", "score": 9, "route": "20250914-20260913/2607.01752v1", "published": "2026-07-02", "publication_date": "2026-07-02", "publication_date_precision": "day", "publication_date_source": "https://arxiv.org/pdf/2607.01752v1", "publication_date_kind": "arxiv_first_submission", "zh_title": "", "summary": "", "tags": [], "reading_status": "pending"}, {"id": "arxiv:2607.01022", "title": "Seahorse: A Unified Benchmarking Framework for Spatiotemporal Event Modeling", "score": 9, "route": "20250914-20260913/2607.01022v1", "published": "2026-07-01", "publication_date": "2026-07-01", "publication_date_precision": "day", "publication_date_source": "https://arxiv.org/pdf/2607.01022v1", "publication_date_kind": "arxiv_first_submission", "zh_title": "", "summary": "", "tags": [], "reading_status": "pending"}, {"id": "arxiv:2511.22096", "title": "Density-based Neural Temporal Point Processes for Heartbeat Dynamics", "score": 9, "route": "20250914-20260913/2511.22096v1", "published": "2025-11-27", "publication_date": "2025-11-27", "publication_date_precision": "day", "publication_date_source": "https://arxiv.org/pdf/2511.22096v1", "publication_date_kind": "arxiv_first_submission", "zh_title": "", "summary": "", "tags": [], "reading_status": "pending"}, {"id": "arxiv:2606.24982", "title": "Latent Block-Diffusion Temporal Point Processes: A Semi-Autoregressive Framework for Asynchronous Event Sequence Generation", "score": 9, "route": "20250914-20260913/2606.24982v1", "published": "2026-06-23", "publication_date": "2026-06-23", "publication_date_precision": "day", "publication_date_source": "https://arxiv.org/pdf/2606.24982v1", "publication_date_kind": "arxiv_first_submission", "zh_title": "", "summary": "", "tags": [], "reading_status": "pending"}, {"id": "work:1a3064af9c2021429cc13711", "title": "Transformers for Mixed-type Event Sequences", "score": 9, "route": "conference/neurips-2025/openreview-neurips-2025-mtwsrjpzhf-transformers-for-mixed-type-event-sequences", "published": "2025", "publication_date": "2025", "publication_date_precision": "year", "publication_date_source": "conference year only; exact release date unverified", "publication_date_kind": "unknown", "zh_title": "", "summary": "", "tags": [], "reading_status": "pending"}, {"id": "work:671946240b20fe880c62e4cf", "title": "Addressing Mark Imbalance in Integration-free Marked Temporal Point Processes", "score": 9, "route": "conference/neurips-2025/openreview-neurip